ntegers and beyond}, author={Bryna Kra and Joel Moreira and Florian K. Richter and Donald Robertson}, year={2025}, eprint={2311.06197}, archivePrefix={arXiv}, primaryClass={math.CO}, url={https://arxiv.org/abs/2311.06197}, }\nSubmitted 14 May 2025\n\n# Problems on infinite sumset configurations in the integers and beyond\n\nBK\n\nBryna Kra\n\nJM\n\nJoel Moreira\n\nFK\n\nFlorian K. Richter\n\nDR\n\nDonald Robertson\n\n## Abstract\n\nIn contrast to finite arithmetic configurations, relatively little is known about which infinite patterns can be found in every set of natural numbers with positive density. Building on recent advances showing infinite sumsets can be found, we explore numerous open problems and obstructions to finding other infinite configurations in every set of natural numbers with positive density.\n\nView PaperPDF\n\n2\n\nCite\n\n## AI Overview\n\nNo overview yet. Generate one to research the paper and explain its contribution.\n\n## Audio\n\nAudio summary Two hosts talking through the paper's ideas, methods and results.\n\n## Similar papers\n\n## Discussion\n\nComment\n\n15 views\n\nv2\n\n## BibTeX\n\nCopy\n\n@misc{kra2025problemsinfinitesumsetconfigurations, title={Problems on infinite sumset configurations in the integers and beyond}, author={Bryna Kra and Joel Moreira and Florian K. Richter and Donald Robertson}, year={2025}, eprint={2311.06197}, archivePrefix={arXiv}, primaryClass={math.CO}, url={https://arxiv.org/abs/2311.06197}, }--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nJoel Moreira (https://warwick.ac.uk/fac/sci/maths/people/staff/moreira/joelmoreiracv.pdf)\nciteturn4search14 [wordlim: 200] Published: 9 months ago; Available at https://arxiv.org/abs/2311.06197 ... https://arxiv.org/abs/2206.01786\n• A combinatorial proof of a sumset conjecture of Furstenberg, with Daniel Glasscock ... Advances in Mathematics 443 (2024) Paper No. 109597, 50 pp. ... primes, with Andreas Koutsogiannis, Anh N.\n---------